    "title": "THAT'S A LOT OF HAMILTONS",
    "text": "Thursday, September 25, 2025\nThis property at 152 Hamilton Ave. was sold Sept. 22 for $1.78 million, according to Residential Properties Ltd. The five-bedroom raised ranch was marketed as a bucolic, peaceful retreat 700 feet from Mackerel Cove. RPL sales associate Jami Krause represented the buyer; the Mackinney Gold Group of Mott & Chace Sotheby’s Intl. represented the seller.",
